    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey prof, i'm stuck on this signal processing stuff. i get the math of the fourier transform with the integrals and all, but i don't really get the actual intuition. like, what am I actually doing to a signal when i transform it? how does it even \"break down\" into frequencies?",
      "source": "evaluator"
